---
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`What ${SITE.name} collects, what it does not, and what happens when you follow a link to a casino.`}
>
  <h1 class="text-[32px] sm:text-[38px]">Privacy policy</h1>

  <Prose>
    <p class="mt-5 text-ink-300">Last updated: 8 September 2026</p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>
      There are no accounts on this site, so there is nothing to sign up for and no personal
      details to give us. We measure how pages are used, and we count clicks on outbound
      links. We do not sell anything about you to anyone.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 and Microsoft Clarity to
      understand which pages are read and where the interface confuses people. These set
      cookies and record interactions such as scrolling and clicks. IP addresses are
      anonymised. Consent defaults to denied until you grant it.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Outbound clicks.</strong> When you use a <strong>Visit site</strong> button, our
      server records which casino was clicked, which page it was clicked from, and the country
      the request came from, before redirecting you. No cookie and no identifier is involved;
      the record cannot be traced back to an individual.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Standard server logs.</strong> Our host, Cloudflare, processes requests and
      keeps operational logs as part of delivering the site.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Names, email addresses or payment details — we never ask for them</li>
      <li>Anything you do after you leave for a casino</li>
      <li>Advertising profiles; we run no ad network and set no advertising cookies</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>When you leave for a casino</h2>
    <p>
      Following an outbound link takes you to an operator we do not control. The referral is
      identified so the casino knows the visit came from us, which is how commission is
      attributed. From that point their privacy policy applies, not ours, and anything you
      subsequently give them — identity documents included — is between you and them.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      Declining consent stops the analytics cookies. Blocking scripts in your browser or with
      an extension works too and breaks nothing on this site — everything here is static HTML
      and reads fine with JavaScript disabled.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
